<title>UK: Lehman sets call warrants on BASF.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets call warrants on BASF.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on BASF AG shares, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant control one share.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>    Maturity    Strike   Price   Premium   Gearing</p>
<p>    (date)	(DEM)    (DEM)   (pct)     (times)</p>
<p>    13.JUN.97   47.5     3.40     6.04     14.12</p>
<p>    13.JUN.97   50.0     2.15     8.65     22.32</p>
<p>    15.JAN.99   50.0     5.55    15.73	8.65</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>Common terms:</p>
<p>    Payment date	   October 1</p>
<p>    Minimum exercise     100 warrants</p>
<p>    Minimum trade	  100 warrants</p>
<p>    Reference price	48 DEM</p>
<p>    Governing law	  German</p>
<p>    Listing		  Duesseldorf, Frankfurt, Stuttgart</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
